msgctxt "AdditionalOptions|"
msgid ""
"When checked, the random slopes of repeated measures factors are omitted as "
"in JASP <=0.16. Omitting the random slopes may yield completely different "
"results from the frequentist ANOVA."
msgstr ""
"Indien aangevinkt, worden de willekeurige hellingen van factoren met "
"herhaalde metingen weggelaten zoals werd gedaan in JASP <=0.16. Het weglaten "
"van de willekeurige hellingen kan totaal andere resultaten opleveren dan de "
"frequentistische ANOVA."

